          "features": {
            "displayValues": [
              "5 Customizable Angles: Our adjustable volleyball rebounder net can adjust the angles to train volleying, bumping, spiking and other actions. Engineered for players of all levels— from beginners to professional players. The adjustable function simulates the near-real game scene, making the training more flexible",
              "Pro-Grade Quality: Constructed with durable HDPE netting, elastic cords and metal ground stakes, our volleyball rebounder net ensures consistent tension even after high-impact hits, The thick anti-rust powder-coated steel tubes and sturdy frames provide additional stability",
              "Multi-Versatility: The volleyball rebounder net offers a 28-square-foot practice area, equipped with elastic cords that maintan consistent tension across all angles. Suitable for volleyball, baseball, lacrosse, and soccer training. Whether it is solo/team training, this volleyball training equipment can meet your training needs, ideal for your training plan",
              "All-in-One Kit: Including a volleyball rebounder net, 30 elastic cords, 2 lock pins, thick anti-rust powder-coated steel tubes, reinforced support poles, 1 target webbing, and 4 metal ground stakes, a paper manual",
              "Easy to Assemble: The push-button design lets you set it up instantly—just push, lock, and play anywhere. Comes with a detailed paper manual for hassle-free setup. Practice your skills in the backyard, on the grass, or indoors/outdoors",
              "Our Service: Offering you the premium products and serving all your needs has always been our goal. Enjoy lifelong assistance, worry-free 18-month warranty, and friendly customer service"
